{
    "title": "GPS Location, Maps, Navigation",
    "description": "GPS Location, Maps, Navigation helps to find the current location, route directions, nearest places, address and can get the location history. You can also find the address from location points.\r\n\r\nThis app helps to find the location, just enter the address you will find the location on the map and can share that location, but it will not store that location. You can also find the GPS co ordinates of the location that you want by entering the address.\r\n\r\nGPS Location, Maps, Navigation helps with driving directions, live maps, voice navigation features. Get the right driving directions, follow the traffic alerts, weather info, voice navigation to reach the destination and make your driving easy. You can find the address of a GPS Location & simply find the history route maps of your journey. \r\n\r\nFind any Address: Simply find the address with a location or get the location by just entering the address on the map.\r\n\r\nGPS Navigation: Use the voice navigation to find the location and to travel from one place to another location. It will just display the current location of user and share the address. Enter any place to get the GPS Location.\r\n\r\nTraffic Alerts: Leave the most traffic route and choose the shortest path with less traffic, you can overcome traffic with traffic alerts. \r\n\r\nCompass: Use different features with sensor compass. GPS Compass shows directions relative to the geographic cardinal directions with Map and Satellite View.\r\n\r\nNear by Places: Find\u00a0various near by places & neighborly places on Google Map like Airports, Fuel Stations, Restaurants, Schools, Hotels, Hospitals, Public Transport, Theaters and many more. Check out the neighborly place and their location details.\r\n\r\nLocation History: Record your location history and save the places you want. Easily get the direction with single tap of your saved places. Helpful in navigation in new places. Get the location history of your route, you may also change the time interval of the routes. You may also change the map styles as well. This app shows the current location by using your Mobile GPS, it will not store any personal data.\r\n\r\nIt provides the following features:\r\n\r\n   * Simply enter the source and destination to find the directions of your route.\r\n   * Near by places helps to find the near by Hospitals, Restaurants, Banks etc.\r\n   * Compass shows directions relative to the geographic directions with map view.\r\n   * It will show the accurate traffic updates, you can save the time by avoiding traffic.\r\n   * You can find the updated weather info of current location and different places.\r\n\r\nThis app will not store any of user personal data.",
    "descriptionHTML": "GPS Location, Maps, Navigation helps to find the current location, route directions, nearest places, address and can get the location history. You can also find the address from location points.<br><br>This app helps to find the location, just enter the address you will find the location on the map and can share that location, but it will not store that location. You can also find the GPS co ordinates of the location that you want by entering the address.<br><br>GPS Location, Maps, Navigation helps with driving directions, live maps, voice navigation features. Get the right driving directions, follow the traffic alerts, weather info, voice navigation to reach the destination and make your driving easy. You can find the address of a GPS Location &amp; simply find the history route maps of your journey. <br><br>Find any Address: Simply find the address with a location or get the location by just entering the address on the map.<br><br>GPS Navigation: Use the voice navigation to find the location and to travel from one place to another location. It will just display the current location of user and share the address. Enter any place to get the GPS Location.<br><br>Traffic Alerts: Leave the most traffic route and choose the shortest path with less traffic, you can overcome traffic with traffic alerts. <br><br>Compass: Use different features with sensor compass. GPS Compass shows directions relative to the geographic cardinal directions with Map and Satellite View.<br><br>Near by Places: Find\u00a0various near by places &amp; neighborly places on Google Map like Airports, Fuel Stations, Restaurants, Schools, Hotels, Hospitals, Public Transport, Theaters and many more. Check out the neighborly place and their location details.<br><br>Location History: Record your location history and save the places you want. Easily get the direction with single tap of your saved places. Helpful in navigation in new places. Get the location history of your route, you may also change the time interval of the routes. You may also change the map styles as well. This app shows the current location by using your Mobile GPS, it will not store any personal data.<br><br>It provides the following features:<br><br>   * Simply enter the source and destination to find the directions of your route.<br>   * Near by places helps to find the near by Hospitals, Restaurants, Banks etc.<br>   * Compass shows directions relative to the geographic directions with map view.<br>   * It will show the accurate traffic updates, you can save the time by avoiding traffic.<br>   * You can find the updated weather info of current location and different places.<br><br>This app will not store any of user personal data.",
